/Essay on the Life of Prince Henry the Navigator"á
ÑO autor aborda temas como as energias, os bloqueios energeticos, a corrente mental humana, perguntas e respostas sobre o medium curador, o tato magnetico, o ectoplasma, os elementos fluidicos e o duplo eterico, na vertente do magnetismo na saude dos pacientes."ú
ôThe Algarve is the region that lies to the west of the Continental Europe, its coastline facing the Atlantic waters, is where reciprocally crossed cultures, from the most ancient times of antiquity. This book seeks to offer the tourist a small sample of the wealth of cultural heritage, nature and flora through original photographs chosen by the author of his private collection over the years. At the end you will learn an unknown Algarve but rich in its diversity that constitutes the evolutionary wealth of every people from Algarve."ü
úIt seems "Quiet, Wyatt" is always the answer when Wyatt asks to do anything. His father says he's not big enough to help make breakfast, the big kids say he's too young to play with them, and Wyatt's mom says he's not old enough to buy the cute, fluffy puppy from the pet store.Well, Wyatt may be small now, but someday he's going to be big enough to do everything. And he's going to make sure everyone knows it!"†
ùO autor aborda nesta obra, em dois capitulos, no primeiro, a historia resumida do magnetismo do seu ponto de vista, e, no segundo capitulo, a arte de curar pelo curador enquanto poder magnetico exercido pela vontade humana onde magnetiza os remedios ou pomadas que prepara com plantas."∞
≠Le personnage principal du livre est un jeune milieu nomme Michael qui des sa jeunesse a des pouvoirs psychiques tels que la clairvoyance et la projection astrale, la realisation de voyage spirituel du monde faisant plus diverses decouvertes les.
D'un certain point dans leur vie rend compte qu'il a le pouvoir de guerir les malades et les differentes chirurgies spirituelles boiteux performants, avec leurs amis de l'esprit, sur le plan spirituel.
Avec le passage du temps s'est avere pour aider son amie Theresa aussi un moyen qu'elle a ete condamne a mort par la medecine conventionnelle, d'un cancer, dans le sang.
La priere et l'amour sont les moyens qu'ils utilisent pour atteindre le soulevent a un hopital spirituel, l'astral superieur, pour obtenir de l'aide de medecins esprits dans la guerison des maladies.
Est-dix-huit histoires passionnantes et mobiles qui feront le lecteur en savoir plus sur la spiritualite qui nous entoure."∞
≠Le personnage principal du livre est un jeune milieu nomme Michael qui des sa jeunesse a des pouvoirs psychiques tels que la clairvoyance et la projection astrale, la realisation de voyage spirituel du monde faisant plus diverses decouvertes les. D'un certain point dans leur vie rend compte qu'il a le pouvoir de guerir les malades et les differentes chirurgies spirituelles boiteux performants, avec leurs amis de l'esprit, sur le plan spirituel. Avec le passage du temps s'est avere pour aider son amie Theresa aussi un moyen qu'elle a ete condamne a mort par la medecine conventionnelle, d'un cancer, dans le sang. La priere et l'amour sont les moyens qu'ils utilisent pour atteindre le soulevent a un hopital spirituel, l'astral superieur, pour obtenir de l'aide de medecins esprits dans la guerison des maladies. Est-dix-huit histoires passionnantes et mobiles qui feront le lecteur en savoir plus sur la spiritualite qui nous entoure."—
ŒThe main character from the book is a young medium named Michael who from his youth has psychic powers such as clairvoyance and astral projection, achieving spiritual travel the world doing the most diverse discoveries.
From a certain point in his life realizes that it has the power to heal the sick people and the lame performing various spiritual surgeries, with their spirit friends, on the spiritual plane.
With the passage of time turned out to help his friend Theresa also a medium that she was condemned to die by conventional medicine, from cancer, in the blood.
Pray and love are the means they use to achieve lift him up to a spiritual hospital, the higher astral, to get help from doctors spirits in curing diseases.
Is eighteen exciting and moving stories that will make the reader know more about the spirituality that surrounds us."ÿ
’A personagem principal desde livro e um jovem medium chamado Michael que desde a sua juventude tem poderes mediunicos, como a videncia e o desdobramento astral, conseguindo viajar pelo mundo espiritual fazendo as mais diversas descobertas sobre assuntos que gostava de ver esclarecidos.
A partir de um determinado momento da sua vida apercebe-se que tem o poder de curar as pessoas doentes e os paraliticos realizando varias cirurgias espirituais, com os seus amigos espiritos, no plano espiritual.
Com o passar do tempo acabou por ajudar a sua amiga Theresa tambem ela uma medium que estava condenada a morrer pela medicina convencional, com um cancro, no sangue.
A oracao e o amor sao os meios que eles utilizam para conseguirem elevar-se ate um Hospital espiritual, no astral superior, para conseguirem a ajuda de espiritos medicos, na cura das doencas. Sao dezoito historias emocionantes e comoventes que farao o leitor conhecer mais da espiritualidade que nos rodeia no mundo."ÿ
